# Negative controls for the ingestion path
#
# Each entry injects one defect, runs the thing that would have to notice it, and
# reverts. Output is what the command printed, filtered to its verdict lines and
# otherwise unedited.
#
# The suite under test is src/tests/conformance/ingest-shape: files written in THIS
# repository in the ingested dialect. No third-party suite is present, retrieved or read.

