[control-102-the-suites-raw-flag-is-taken-for-artifact-bytes]
The adapter carries the raw flag straight across. In the ingested dialect it means "no harness prelude and no strictness variant" and the file is still source; in this harness it means artifact bytes no front end lowers.
exit 3
FAIL the-suites-raw-flag-is-source-and-not-artifact-bytes: 1 case in Raw mode carrying source
FAIL a-file-declaring-its-strictness-or-its-goal-becomes-one-case: wrong: raw
