[control-106-a-parse-negative-naming-harness-files-is-declined]
The arm that makes this slice scorable at all is removed: a negative parse test that names harness files is declined, though it must fail before it runs and never reaches one. Judged by the checks, because the retained suite would simply get smaller.
exit 3
