[control-108-the-rule-is-relaxed-and-the-checks-that-failed-are-removed]
Two edits rather than one, because this is the realistic path: somebody relaxes the rule, four
harness checks go red, and the checks are deleted to make the build green. The self-check is the
second line of defence and it holds - three fixtures whose refusal the manifest made, not the
language, report a verdict they must not.
exit 3
